      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Entry Fees: \nEntry fees should be set reasonably to encourage participation.
    The entry fee cannot exceed the maximum amount specified by the platform.distribution)
    are clearly stated and accurately reflect the tournament structure.\n\nPrize
    Distribution: \nPrizes must be distributed according to the structure outlined
    when the tournament is created. Creators cannot alter prize distribution after
    the tournament begins.\n\nDuration: \nTournament duration should be set to allow
    ample time for participants to join and compete. Creators must adhere to the
    minimum and maximum duration limits set by the platform.\n\nMaximum Participants:
    \nTournaments can have a set maximum number of participants. This limit must
    be specified when the tournament is created and cannot be changed once the tournament
    has started."
