  m_text: "No Exploitation: \nCreators must not exploit the tournament system for
    personal gain, such as artificially inflating participant numbers or manipulating
    results.\n\nIntegrity: \nCreators are expected to maintain integrity and honesty
    in managing their tournaments. Any form of cheating, collusion, or dishonest
    behavior will result in penalties, including possible suspension or banning from
    the platform.\n\nCommunication: \nCreators must communicate clearly and respectfully
    with participants. Harassment, threats, or any form of abusive communication
    will not be tolerated.\n"
